sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Desk as Priya and Ellie
    participant Ada as Ada (chat model)
    participant Store as Memory store
    participant BG as Background model
    participant Code as MemoRizz checks
    actor Lead as Dev (Desk Lead)

    loop through the week
        Desk->>Ada: "Customer update for CW-431640..."
        Ada->>Store: save the turn (episodic log)
        Ada-->>Desk: a draft
    end
    Note over Ada,BG: later, off the turn
    Store->>BG: the handlers' own messages, by conversation
    BG-->>Code: one sentence + quotes, and one rule + corrections
    Code->>Store: is each quote in that conversation, word for word?
    Code->>Code: enough conversations? two people? safe wording?
    Code->>Store: proposals wait on the saved agent
    Lead->>Store: approve the sentence, with a name
    Lead->>Store: approve the rule, as its owner
    Store-->>Ada: a new persona version, in every prompt from now on
